meta {
  name: Raise committee signal
  type: http
  seq: 29
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sessions/:id/signals
  body: json
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  id: 230
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "kind": "OCS",
    "deviceId": "08:D1:F9:C8:4D:24",
    "detail": ""
  }
}

docs {
  Target is 230, the abandoned two-boat test session (it already carries an
  SCP and an ABANDON). Writes to the live Turso DB.

  A terminal DSQ/DNF/RET freezes the standings of a FINISHED race; on an
  abandoned session status is stored, so nothing un-abandons it.
}
